Tue Nov 10 05:01:45 UTC 2026 - Caio César Ortega <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Update to 1.2.11
  * Fix wrong cursor position inside archives in Brief View (#3055)
  * Fix cm_MarkPlus count in Search Results Duplicates (#3169)
  * Fix opening files from archive in flat view subfolders (#3102)
  * Qt: fix Down arrow scrolling up in Copy/Move dialog (#2197)
  * Fix free space indicator drawing and highlighter default filters
- doublecmd-lazarus3-thumbview-scroll.patch is still needed (Backports
  still ships Lazarus 3.6)

