Sat Nov  7 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of Double Commander 1.2.10 for openSUSE Leap 16.0
  * Build against Lazarus 3.6 from openSUSE:Backports:SLE-16.0
  * Ship two mutually exclusive packages, doublecmd-gtk (GTK 2)
    and doublecmd-qt (Qt 6)
  * Do not install the polkit policy; privileged operations use
    the generic pkexec action
  * Install /usr/bin/doublecmd as a wrapper script
  * Add doublecmd-lazarus3-thumbview-scroll.patch:
    TCustomGrid.TrySmoothScrollBy only exists in Lazarus 4, so fall
    back to scrolling by one row through TopRow
